; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR SEABATTLE  -  you against the computer   (loads at $4000, SETSIZE 2)
; ==========================================================================
; Load, cold-boot, press SPACE. Both fleets (carrier 5, battleship 4, cruiser 3,
; submarine 3, destroyer 2) are placed at random; R shuffles yours, SPACE starts.
; Arrow keys aim over ENEMY WATERS, SPACE or Enter fires; or type a square (B7,
; J10) to jump there. The computer hunts on a checkerboard and then works round
; each hit. First to sink the other's whole fleet wins. Q gives up (its ships are
; shown), ESC quits, SPACE plays again.
;
; VT100: cursor addressing, erase to end of line, reverse video, hide/show
; cursor. No scrolling. Uses $4000-$5FFF (SETSIZE 2).
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/seabattle_verify.py, V0061.34): PASS 2026-11-06 (renamed; the games unchanged)
; HW-VERIFIED on the Elf2K (V0061.34), 2026-10-01 - Craig: it works.
;
; 705 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

